{
    "title": "4 Pics 1 Word",
    "description": "THE #1 WORD GUESS GAME WITH OVER 400,000,000 PLAYERS WORLDWIDE!\r\n\r\n4 pictures that have 1 word in common \u2014 can you guess the word?\r\n\r\nFind out why everyone loves this logic game, guess the word and JOIN THE FUN NOW!\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2605ENDLESS FUN WITH NEW PUZZLES & PICTURE GAMES!\u2605\r\nCan you solve the puzzle and unlock the levels? Challenge yourself with countless puzzles and riddles, from easy to tricky are waiting for you! New daily word puzzles are added continuously for endless brain training picture games!\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2605PURE, INSTANT FUN\u2605\r\nNo registration, and no complicated rules. Just start playing challenging picture games, guess the word, and have fun! New challenges and riddles are always available, Unlock fun picture games and sticker albums with our special guessing categories in Daily Puzzle. Play free offline games without WiFi wherever you are.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2605SOLVE THE PUZZLE, GUESS THE WORD AND GET REWARDED\u2605\r\nFind hidden meanings, guess the word, and earn coins to unlock free hints or catch up on missed Daily Puzzles in this classic game! \r\n\r\n\r\n\u2605FUN PICTURE GAMES WITH FRIENDS\u2605\r\nThe game got you stumped? Friends and family can help you solve the puzzle and guess the word via Social Media or Text Messages. Word search game with friends lets you ask for help and share tips. \r\n\r\n\r\n\u2605SIMPLE AND HIGHLY ADDICTIVE LOGIC PUZZLE GAMES\u2605\r\nLook at the four pictures; Guess the word and its meaning. Find out what they have in common. Win with our logic games, challenges and riddles! Show your vocabulary power by finding all the hidden phrases.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2605ONE OF THE MOST ADDICTIVE BRAIN TEASER TRAINING GAMES IN THE WORLD!\u2605\r\nJoin us, solve the puzzle, and improve your vocabulary or spelling skills across the globe in 9 languages. \r\n\r\n4 pics 1 Word is an addictive daily puzzle game you can play alone or with friends and family. With free logic games, exciting image packs, and challenging daily puzzles and riddles, you'll have endless hours of brain training. Guess the word, earn coins & train your brain wherever you are.\r\n\r\nWe want to make sure you have the best time playing our game. Contact us at games@lotum.de",
    "descriptionHTML": "THE #1 WORD GUESS GAME WITH OVER 400,000,000 PLAYERS WORLDWIDE!<br><br>4 pictures that have 1 word in common \u2014 can you guess the word?<br><br>Find out why everyone loves this logic game, guess the word and JOIN THE FUN NOW!<br><br><br>\u2605ENDLESS FUN WITH NEW PUZZLES &amp; PICTURE GAMES!\u2605<br>Can you solve the puzzle and unlock the levels? Challenge yourself with countless puzzles and riddles, from easy to tricky are waiting for you! New daily word puzzles are added continuously for endless brain training picture games!<br><br><br>\u2605PURE, INSTANT FUN\u2605<br>No registration, and no complicated rules. Just start playing challenging picture games, guess the word, and have fun! New challenges and riddles are always available, Unlock fun picture games and sticker albums with our special guessing categories in Daily Puzzle. Play free offline games without WiFi wherever you are.<br><br><br>\u2605SOLVE THE PUZZLE, GUESS THE WORD AND GET REWARDED\u2605<br>Find hidden meanings, guess the word, and earn coins to unlock free hints or catch up on missed Daily Puzzles in this classic game! <br><br><br>\u2605FUN PICTURE GAMES WITH FRIENDS\u2605<br>The game got you stumped? Friends and family can help you solve the puzzle and guess the word via Social Media or Text Messages. Word search game with friends lets you ask for help and share tips. <br><br><br>\u2605SIMPLE AND HIGHLY ADDICTIVE LOGIC PUZZLE GAMES\u2605<br>Look at the four pictures; Guess the word and its meaning. Find out what they have in common. Win with our logic games, challenges and riddles! Show your vocabulary power by finding all the hidden phrases.<br><br><br>\u2605ONE OF THE MOST ADDICTIVE BRAIN TEASER TRAINING GAMES IN THE WORLD!\u2605<br>Join us, solve the puzzle, and improve your vocabulary or spelling skills across the globe in 9 languages. <br><br>4 pics 1 Word is an addictive daily puzzle game you can play alone or with friends and family. With free logic games, exciting image packs, and challenging daily puzzles and riddles, you&#39;ll have endless hours of brain training. Guess the word, earn coins &amp; train your brain wherever you are.<br><br>We want to make sure you have the best time playing our game. Contact us at games@lotum.de",
